# Glacierwood Siege, Sultai: "You may play lands from your graveyard." Bot1 pays {1}{G}{U} with Black Lotus (blue) and Mox
# Emerald, names Sultai, then casts Faithless Looting with Mox Ruby: it draws a Forest and an Island and discards the Forest and
# the Island, so a Forest and an Island sit in the graveyard. Bot1 plays the graveyard Forest as its land for the turn, and the
# Forest left in hand is then refused (CR 305.2: one land play). Sultai does not mill on an instant or sorcery: casting the
# Looting milled nobody.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Glacierwood Siege
Faithless Looting
Forest
Forest
Forest
Island
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Glacierwood Siege.Cast
Bot1.Name(Sultai)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Glacierwood Siege.ChosenOption = Sultai
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Forest; Island)
? Bot2.Library.Count = 13
? Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Island; Forest; Black Lotus
Bot1.Graveyard.Forest.Play
! Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play

[Expect]
Bot1.LandsPlayed = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Island; Black Lotus
